WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.800
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.070 --> 01:43.050
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.690 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 11]

5
01:53.200 --> 01:54.710
[Ferry]

6
01:55.840 --> 01:56.700
Excuse me, sir.

7
01:57.789 --> 01:58.680
Are there any ships heading to

8
01:58.680 --> 02:00.280
Mingling County, Qingzhou?

9
02:00.590 --> 02:01.590
Heading south?

10
02:01.870 --> 02:03.310
See the ship with the "Gong" flag?

11
02:03.310 --> 02:04.510
It came from Qingzhou.

12
02:04.510 --> 02:05.430
Go ask them.

13
02:05.590 --> 02:06.400
Thank you.

14
02:09.080 --> 02:10.120
There's a ship?

15
02:13.870 --> 02:14.840
Be careful.

16
02:16.000 --> 02:16.800
Freeze.

17
02:17.590 --> 02:18.520
Zhenzhu?

18
02:20.590 --> 02:21.400
Meng Rui?

19
02:21.710 --> 02:23.120
What brings you here?

20
02:23.310 --> 02:25.079
Yan, what a coincidence.

21
02:25.180 --> 02:26.280
Aren't you on leave?

22
02:26.280 --> 02:27.210
Why are you here?

23
02:28.520 --> 02:30.120
I am on leave.

24
02:30.190 --> 02:31.280
I'm just about to take a ship

25
02:31.280 --> 02:32.630
to travel south.

26
02:32.840 --> 02:34.130
South?

27
02:34.710 --> 02:35.970
Is it Mingling County?

28
02:37.870 --> 02:38.680
Come on.

29
02:39.079 --> 02:40.680
We all know what's going on.

30
02:40.710 --> 02:41.870
How could I not know

31
02:41.910 --> 02:43.120
what is on your mind?

32
02:43.520 --> 02:45.060
You Little Ice Cube.

33
02:45.190 --> 02:46.870
You can fool the Chief,

34
02:46.910 --> 02:48.470
but you can't fool me.

35
02:48.910 --> 02:51.310
Resting and feeling homesick?

36
02:51.310 --> 02:52.520
No one would believe these words

37
02:52.520 --> 02:53.280
coming from

38
02:53.280 --> 02:54.400
a Constable Ghost's mouth.

39
02:54.400 --> 02:55.329
Right, Zhenzhu?

40
02:57.079 --> 02:58.310
I figure

41
02:58.310 --> 02:59.400
Mingling County

42
02:59.420 --> 03:01.270
must have a

43
03:01.590 --> 03:02.910
huge case.

44
03:03.680 --> 03:05.410
You want to go there without me?

45
03:06.680 --> 03:07.590
No way!

46
03:07.800 --> 03:08.910
This is what it means

47
03:08.910 --> 03:10.910
to face dangers together—

48
03:10.960 --> 03:12.560
And solve cases together.

49
03:13.280 --> 03:15.310
Let's go. I've asked about the ship.

50
03:16.610 --> 03:16.710
[Ferry]

51
03:16.710 --> 03:18.570
This trip is of great importance.

52
03:18.630 --> 03:19.630
Tell the brothers

53
03:19.680 --> 03:21.030
to stay alert.

54
03:21.630 --> 03:23.560
Excuse me, is there a boatman here?

55
03:25.190 --> 03:26.190
Are you the owner?

56
03:26.370 --> 03:27.540
Officer,

57
03:27.680 --> 03:29.310
you can't just say that.

58
03:29.310 --> 03:30.240
Who doesn't know

59
03:30.550 --> 03:31.829
that on the sea,

60
03:31.850 --> 03:33.150
all the Gong family's ships

61
03:33.150 --> 03:34.900
belong to Old Madam Gong?

62
03:34.930 --> 03:36.980
I am Shama Reda.

63
03:37.370 --> 03:38.760
I am just a manager

64
03:38.790 --> 03:40.310
in charge of chores.

65
03:40.680 --> 03:41.610
The Gong family?

66
03:41.910 --> 03:44.120
The Gong family of Mingling County, Qingzhou?

67
03:44.120 --> 03:45.079
On the sea,

68
03:45.630 --> 03:47.290
there is only one Gong family.

69
03:48.310 --> 03:49.870
What a boast.

70
03:50.840 --> 03:52.280
He's not wrong.

71
03:52.430 --> 03:53.890
Among civilian shipping,

72
03:54.030 --> 03:56.240
the Gong family was appointed by His Majesty

73
03:56.240 --> 03:57.750
for official transport.

74
03:58.590 --> 03:59.910
No matter whose ship this is,

75
03:59.910 --> 04:00.710
are you

76
04:00.710 --> 04:02.800
going to Mingling County, Qingzhou?

77
04:02.870 --> 04:04.000
We are about to go back there.

78
04:04.000 --> 04:04.800
Great.

79
04:05.120 --> 04:05.820
Let's go.

80
04:05.820 --> 04:06.870
[Ferry]

81
04:06.870 --> 04:07.680
Officer,

82
04:07.810 --> 04:08.940
I'm terribly sorry.

83
04:09.310 --> 04:11.240
This ship doesn't take outsiders.

84
04:11.680 --> 04:13.710
You should find another ship.

85
04:13.710 --> 04:14.630
Why?

86
04:15.120 --> 04:16.880
It's not like we won't pay you.

87
04:16.930 --> 04:18.779
Who wouldn't want money?

88
04:19.040 --> 04:20.310
But this ship

89
04:20.310 --> 04:21.430
has already been chartered

90
04:21.430 --> 04:22.390
by another official.

91
04:22.390 --> 04:23.190
Official?

92
04:30.040 --> 04:30.970
Qingyang?

93
04:31.430 --> 04:32.700
As the saying goes,

94
04:33.040 --> 04:34.870
"Meet a kindred soul aboard a boat,

95
04:34.870 --> 04:36.600
and entrust your life to the boundless sea."

96
04:36.600 --> 04:38.800
A God of Wealth insists on following us,

97
04:39.430 --> 04:40.800
which is exactly what we want.

98
04:40.800 --> 04:42.130
What are we waiting for?

99
04:42.430 --> 04:43.340
Get on board.

100
04:43.340 --> 04:43.870
♪ I open the door to winds of change ♪

101
04:43.870 --> 04:44.680
Let's go.

102
04:46.070 --> 04:47.270
You brat.

103
04:47.340 --> 04:50.080
♪ With no desire to gaze at the stars ♪

104
04:51.380 --> 04:54.070
♪ Dreams may soothe the pain ♪

105
04:55.220 --> 04:58.150
♪ But they're too easily disturbed ♪

106
04:58.659 --> 05:00.790
♪ So I'll stand up high on a tower ♪

107
05:01.290 --> 05:03.130
♪ Never looking away ♪

108
05:03.620 --> 05:05.170
♪ And see how so-called fate ♪

109
05:05.240 --> 05:05.680
Great.

110
05:05.680 --> 05:06.870
♪ Makes choices for me ♪

111
05:06.870 --> 05:07.600
The reward

112
05:07.600 --> 05:07.640
will have to be divided into one more share.

113
05:07.640 --> 05:09.190
♪ Let the breathtaking ♪

114
05:09.190 --> 05:09.820
Sanhuo.

115
05:09.820 --> 05:10.430
♪ Take the place of cold, lonely stars ♪

116
05:10.430 --> 05:11.270
Don't worry.

117
05:11.690 --> 05:11.720
♪ Cutting through the mist ♪

118
05:11.720 --> 05:12.600
This time,

119
05:12.680 --> 05:13.520
I sneaked out.

120
05:13.520 --> 05:14.120
♪ To light up my eyes ♪

121
05:14.120 --> 05:15.310
I'll be lucky enough if the Chief

122
05:15.310 --> 05:16.030
doesn't punish me when I get back.

123
05:16.030 --> 05:16.510
♪ If the moonlight is hidden and the candles burn out ♪

124
05:16.510 --> 05:17.310
How could I

125
05:17.830 --> 05:19.330
take a share of the reward?

126
05:19.330 --> 05:21.030
♪ And I can't see myself ♪

127
05:24.100 --> 05:26.710
♪ I believe some unseen longing surges within ♪

128
05:27.260 --> 05:29.070
♪ Pulling me along ♪

129
05:29.360 --> 05:30.160
Come on.

130
05:30.950 --> 05:31.680
Why do you guys

131
05:31.680 --> 05:33.120
look so lifeless?

132
05:33.310 --> 05:35.310
This is the first time our Four Divine Constables

133
05:35.310 --> 05:36.600
have gathered together

134
05:36.600 --> 05:37.930
for official business.

135
05:38.120 --> 05:39.190
Don't you think

136
05:39.870 --> 05:41.530
even the scenery along the way

137
05:41.630 --> 05:42.560
has become more

138
05:42.560 --> 05:43.680
charming?

139
05:45.200 --> 05:47.650
♪ After all the twists and turns, through a thousand joys and sorrows ♪

140
05:48.159 --> 05:51.820
♪ I only hope tomorrow finds me still full of courage ♪

141
05:53.000 --> 05:54.659
♪ At daybreak, I'll look back ♪

142
05:55.420 --> 05:59.970
♪ And finally understand why this journey had to be mine ♪

143
06:17.140 --> 06:24.620
[Mingling Serial Corpse Case]

144
06:35.120 --> 06:35.920
Look there.

145
06:36.720 --> 06:37.580
There are fish.

146
06:42.680 --> 06:44.610
Come and look! We're almost there!

147
06:44.690 --> 06:51.870
[Mingling County, Coastal Qingzhou, Great Shi, Early Summer]

148
06:52.340 --> 06:52.920
[Mingling County]

149
06:52.920 --> 06:53.720
Hold it!

150
06:53.720 --> 06:54.360
Okay.

151
06:55.630 --> 06:56.240
Careful.

152
06:56.920 --> 06:57.720
Be quick!

153
06:57.720 --> 06:59.040
Hurry up and bring the ladder over!

154
06:59.040 --> 06:59.720
Hurry!

155
06:59.720 --> 07:00.430
Over there!

156
07:01.270 --> 07:02.600
The weather in the south

157
07:02.720 --> 07:03.920
is indeed different.

158
07:04.090 --> 07:05.240
It's just the beginning of summer,

159
07:05.240 --> 07:06.570
and it's already so hot.

160
07:08.920 --> 07:09.870
Mr. Reda,

161
07:11.040 --> 07:12.640
what are those people doing?

162
07:13.720 --> 07:15.680
They are rushing to dig a flood channel

163
07:15.680 --> 07:17.140
so that if it rains heavily later,

164
07:17.140 --> 07:18.950
the whole county won't be flooded.

165
07:18.950 --> 07:19.750
What?

166
07:19.870 --> 07:20.800
Heavy rain?

167
07:22.680 --> 07:23.810
Who are you kidding?

168
07:24.190 --> 07:25.430
It's so sunny.

169
07:25.430 --> 07:27.040
We're almost dried out.

170
07:27.190 --> 07:28.510
How could there be heavy rain?

171
07:28.510 --> 07:29.480
Well,

172
07:29.630 --> 07:30.940
you have no idea.

173
07:31.310 --> 07:32.630
Our Mingling County

174
07:32.870 --> 07:34.390
is backed by Mount Fuyao

175
07:34.510 --> 07:35.680
and faces the sea,

176
07:35.870 --> 07:37.870
with the Yan River flowing through the mountains.

177
07:37.870 --> 07:40.430
The weather and terrain

178
07:40.510 --> 07:42.370
can be different every few miles.

179
07:42.390 --> 07:44.120
One moment it's sunny,

180
07:44.120 --> 07:46.430
and the next it's pouring rain.

181
07:47.000 --> 07:48.510
It's the rainy season now.

182
07:48.630 --> 07:49.510
It rains

183
07:49.510 --> 07:50.600
every few days.

184
07:51.920 --> 07:53.040
A little carelessness

185
07:53.040 --> 07:54.800
will cause floods

186
07:55.070 --> 07:56.310
and trigger a plague.

187
07:56.390 --> 07:57.190
So,

188
07:57.310 --> 07:58.570
we can't be negligent.

189
08:19.160 --> 08:20.390
Thank you. Thank you.

190
08:20.680 --> 08:21.210
Let's go.

191
08:23.070 --> 08:23.870
Careful.

192
08:25.000 --> 08:26.240
Come on, put some effort into it.

193
08:26.240 --> 08:27.070
Excuse me.

194
08:27.070 --> 08:27.430
Watch out.

195
08:27.430 --> 08:28.070
Be careful.

196
08:28.070 --> 08:28.800
Good job, everyone!

197
08:28.800 --> 08:30.680
[Situ Bo, Magistrate of Mingling County]

198
08:30.680 --> 08:32.030
Put some more effort into it!

199
08:32.030 --> 08:32.840
Okay!

200
08:32.860 --> 08:33.650
Okay!

201
08:34.909 --> 08:35.720
My Lord.

202
08:37.200 --> 08:39.260
People from Tianhuang City are here.

203
08:43.440 --> 08:45.900
I'm Situ Bo, magistrate of Mingling County.

204
08:47.600 --> 08:49.320
Greetings, Divine Constables.

205
08:49.320 --> 08:51.030
You are Situ Bo?

206
08:51.480 --> 08:52.440
Yes, I am.

207
08:52.720 --> 08:53.510
Divine Constables,

208
08:53.510 --> 08:55.240
you arrived in Mingling County so suddenly.

209
08:55.240 --> 08:57.080
I didn't have time to change into my official uniform.

210
08:57.080 --> 08:58.030
Please forgive

211
08:58.030 --> 08:59.090
my lack of manners.

212
08:59.840 --> 09:02.200
May I ask what brings you here?

213
09:02.270 --> 09:03.080
Of course,

214
09:03.080 --> 09:04.870
it's for the case you reported.

215
09:05.120 --> 09:06.440
It says that

216
09:06.480 --> 09:07.600
a green-haired demon suddenly appeared

217
09:07.600 --> 09:08.870
in Mingling County.

218
09:09.000 --> 09:11.460
We're here specifically to catch the demon.

219
09:12.030 --> 09:13.720
The story of the green-haired demon

220
09:13.720 --> 09:14.630
has been spreading by word of mouth

221
09:14.630 --> 09:15.720
among the locals.

222
09:15.720 --> 09:17.180
It's mostly exaggerated.

223
09:17.630 --> 09:19.320
But I was afraid it might hurt people,

224
09:19.320 --> 09:20.630
so I led my men in searching for it many times,

225
09:20.630 --> 09:21.990
but we found no trace of it.

226
09:21.990 --> 09:23.870
Reporting it to the Divine Constable Bureau

227
09:23.870 --> 09:25.240
was a last resort.

228
09:26.320 --> 09:27.120
My Lord!

229
09:27.510 --> 09:28.320
Bad news!

230
09:29.270 --> 09:30.000
Bad news, My Lord.

231
09:30.000 --> 09:30.910
A corpse was found

232
09:30.910 --> 09:32.430
in Yan River in Mount Fuyao.

233
09:32.430 --> 09:33.360
My Lord, please go and take a look.

234
09:33.360 --> 09:34.120
Lead the way.

235
09:34.270 --> 09:35.120
Okay.

236
09:40.120 --> 09:40.910
Let's go.

237
09:55.980 --> 09:57.480
Luckily, it was found

238
09:57.510 --> 09:58.110
before the heavy rain.

239
09:58.110 --> 09:59.030
Otherwise, it would have been

240
09:59.030 --> 10:00.120
washed into the sea by now.

241
10:00.120 --> 10:01.670
Mingling is really like you said.

242
10:01.670 --> 10:02.670
The rain comes fast

243
10:02.670 --> 10:03.510
and goes fast.

244
10:03.530 --> 10:05.260
The weather in Mingling is just like this.

245
10:05.260 --> 10:06.120
-Everyone here… -Yan.

246
10:06.120 --> 10:08.180
has some ability to read the weather.

247
10:09.840 --> 10:11.360
It's been soaked like this.

248
10:11.360 --> 10:12.890
We can't even tell who it is.

249
10:27.440 --> 10:28.200
Where is Meng Rui?

250
10:28.200 --> 10:30.130
He went upstream to look for clues.

251
10:30.510 --> 10:31.840
If the killer left any

252
10:31.840 --> 10:32.910
traces,

253
10:32.910 --> 10:33.630
I think

254
10:34.000 --> 10:35.800
he will definitely notice them.

255
10:39.240 --> 10:40.030
How is it?

256
10:40.790 --> 10:42.320
The cause of death was not drowning.

257
10:42.320 --> 10:43.150
In his mouth and nose,

258
10:43.150 --> 10:44.350
there is no river mud.

259
10:44.510 --> 10:46.870
He obviously died before he was thrown into the river.

260
10:46.870 --> 10:49.200
The fatal wound should be here.

261
10:49.320 --> 10:50.520
A ruptured windpipe.

262
10:52.240 --> 10:53.120
This wound...

263
10:53.390 --> 10:54.720
The edges are turned outward,

264
10:54.720 --> 10:56.640
so it wasn't caused by a sharp weapon.

265
10:56.640 --> 10:58.320
I've seen this kind of wound before.

266
10:58.320 --> 10:59.340
It should be...

267
11:00.080 --> 11:01.720
caused by a beast's bite.

268
11:01.720 --> 11:02.520
Could it be...

269
11:02.740 --> 11:04.910
that he was bitten to death by wolves in the mountain?

270
11:04.910 --> 11:05.950
Normally,

271
11:06.390 --> 11:08.200
when wild beasts actively attack humans,

272
11:08.200 --> 11:09.840
it's always for food.

273
11:10.660 --> 11:12.850
But this body is so intact

274
11:13.120 --> 11:14.390
and hasn't been eaten.

275
11:14.830 --> 11:15.640
So,

276
11:16.670 --> 11:17.510
I think

277
11:18.410 --> 11:19.910
there must be something fishy about it.

278
11:19.910 --> 11:20.720
My Lord,

279
11:21.240 --> 11:22.270
nothing like this

280
11:22.320 --> 11:23.200
has ever happened

281
11:23.200 --> 11:24.400
in our county before.

282
11:24.520 --> 11:25.350
Could it be

283
11:25.790 --> 11:27.320
done by that green-haired demon?

284
11:27.320 --> 11:28.670
According to those who have seen it,

285
11:28.670 --> 11:30.510
that demon has long fangs and a green face,

286
11:30.510 --> 11:32.430
with a bloody mouth like a wolf's.

287
11:32.460 --> 11:33.480
Nonsense.

288
11:34.320 --> 11:36.260
Handling cases requires solid evidence.

289
11:36.260 --> 11:37.120
Especially in front of

290
11:37.120 --> 11:38.450
the Divine Constables.

291
11:39.030 --> 11:39.840
Yes.

292
11:41.000 --> 11:42.320
Take the body to the county office first.

293
11:42.320 --> 11:43.510
It needs to be examined carefully.

294
11:43.510 --> 11:44.030
Right.

295
11:44.030 --> 11:44.670
Also,

296
11:44.670 --> 11:46.120
we must find out where the body came from as soon as possible

297
11:46.120 --> 11:47.180
and confirm his identity.

298
11:47.180 --> 11:47.820
Yes.

299
11:47.840 --> 11:48.600
Take it away.

300
11:48.670 --> 11:49.440
Yes.

301
12:18.590 --> 12:20.720
This is the hinterland of Mount Fuyao,

302
12:20.910 --> 12:21.970
called Ghost Gate.

303
12:22.040 --> 12:23.050
Up there are some

304
12:23.200 --> 12:25.620
hanging coffins that are over 1,000 years old.

305
12:25.620 --> 12:27.320
No wonder it's called Ghost Gate.

306
12:27.320 --> 12:28.120
Actually,

307
12:28.390 --> 12:29.510
it's not just because of

308
12:29.510 --> 12:31.120
these hanging coffins that it got its name.

309
12:31.120 --> 12:33.480
It's really because no one dares to come here.

310
12:33.480 --> 12:34.320
Lord Situ.

311
12:34.750 --> 12:35.620
Right now,

312
12:35.840 --> 12:38.080
the green-haired demon in Mingling hasn't been eliminated.

313
12:38.080 --> 12:38.910
And it seems

314
12:39.720 --> 12:41.550
there's been a murder.

315
12:41.600 --> 12:43.400
I hope you can find out the truth.

316
12:44.840 --> 12:45.840
In this mountain,

317
12:46.320 --> 12:47.720
does anyone keep dogs?

318
12:50.920 --> 12:51.870
My Lord,

319
12:52.910 --> 12:54.790
some hunters used to keep them before.

320
12:54.790 --> 12:55.510
But in the past two years,

321
12:55.510 --> 12:56.640
we haven't seen any.

322
12:57.080 --> 12:58.080
Why?

323
12:58.480 --> 12:59.870
They were all taken by the Ji family

324
12:59.870 --> 13:01.390
and kept in the county town.

325
13:01.390 --> 13:02.670
Ji Ada loves dogs.

326
13:02.720 --> 13:03.910
Whenever he sees a good dog,

327
13:03.910 --> 13:05.270
he buys it.

328
13:06.120 --> 13:08.510
There are 2 prominent families in Mingling.

329
13:08.510 --> 13:10.510
One is the Gong family, a major shipping family,

330
13:10.510 --> 13:11.270
and the other

331
13:11.270 --> 13:13.080
is the Ji family, which runs rice shops.

332
13:13.080 --> 13:14.720
The Ji family supplies grain

333
13:14.870 --> 13:16.470
to all the surrounding counties.

334
13:16.470 --> 13:17.680
Their business is huge.

335
13:17.680 --> 13:18.760
The two Ji brothers,

336
13:18.760 --> 13:19.920
Ji Ada and Ji Er,

337
13:19.940 --> 13:21.320
have quite a background.

338
13:21.320 --> 13:23.270
The current Princess Ding

339
13:23.290 --> 13:24.740
is their cousin.

340
13:25.510 --> 13:26.510
I didn't expect

341
13:26.720 --> 13:28.270
this little Mingling

342
13:28.910 --> 13:31.120
to have so many big shots.

343
13:32.880 --> 13:33.940
Divine Constable,

344
13:34.270 --> 13:35.500
you suspect that the man

345
13:35.500 --> 13:37.030
was bitten to death by a dog?

346
13:37.600 --> 13:38.760
If someone really

347
13:38.790 --> 13:39.870
did it on purpose,

348
13:40.200 --> 13:41.390
then using a dog

349
13:41.500 --> 13:42.790
to hurt people

350
13:43.630 --> 13:45.000
is a possibility.

351
13:46.630 --> 13:47.440
However,

352
13:48.080 --> 13:49.350
all of this

353
13:49.600 --> 13:51.240
is just a guess for now.

354
13:51.910 --> 13:52.910
It reminds me of something.

355
13:52.910 --> 13:54.030
Speaking of dogs in the mountains,

356
13:54.030 --> 13:55.270
Ji Ada not only loves dogs,

357
13:55.270 --> 13:56.730
but he also likes hunting.

358
14:00.720 --> 14:01.510
It seems

359
14:01.530 --> 14:02.550
we need to pay a visit

360
14:02.550 --> 14:03.720
to this Ji Ada.

361
14:05.720 --> 14:07.270
We need to investigate Ji Ada

362
14:07.270 --> 14:09.270
and the green-haired demon.

363
14:10.750 --> 14:11.820
Lord Situ,

364
14:11.910 --> 14:13.650
the case report says

365
14:13.720 --> 14:14.870
that the green-haired demon

366
14:14.870 --> 14:17.000
likes to dig up graves and eat carrion.

367
14:18.440 --> 14:20.080
Where is that graveyard?

368
14:21.330 --> 14:23.050
At the northwest foot of Mount Fuyao,

369
14:23.050 --> 14:24.560
there is a mass grave.

370
14:24.710 --> 14:25.720
People have seen

371
14:25.720 --> 14:28.250
the green-haired demon there more than once.

372
14:34.000 --> 14:35.130
Divine Constables,

373
14:35.240 --> 14:36.320
it's just ahead.

374
14:44.440 --> 14:45.240
Everyone.

375
14:46.550 --> 14:47.360
Meng Rui?

376
14:47.440 --> 14:48.240
Meng.

377
14:49.240 --> 14:50.030
Meng Rui?

378
14:50.270 --> 14:51.960
You managed to find this place?

379
14:51.960 --> 14:52.670
How was it?

380
14:53.150 --> 14:54.480
Any clues from searching the mountain?

381
14:54.480 --> 14:55.320
The traces have all been

382
14:55.320 --> 14:56.650
washed away by the rain.

383
14:56.840 --> 14:57.770
I found nothing.

384
15:04.870 --> 15:05.910
How about this?

385
15:06.720 --> 15:08.110
Zhenzhu, Yan,

386
15:08.550 --> 15:09.510
you go back

387
15:09.550 --> 15:11.080
and continue investigating the Ji family.

388
15:11.080 --> 15:12.080
Meng Rui and I

389
15:12.630 --> 15:13.440
will go

390
15:13.530 --> 15:16.060
look for clues about the green-haired demon.

391
15:19.150 --> 15:20.120
Chiying bugs.

392
15:23.550 --> 15:24.360
Alright.

393
15:26.510 --> 15:27.320
Sanhuo,

394
15:27.670 --> 15:29.840
I'll leave Zhenzhu in your care.

395
15:30.510 --> 15:31.320
Don't worry.

396
15:32.470 --> 15:33.670
If you find any

397
15:33.670 --> 15:34.750
clues about the green-haired demon later,

398
15:34.750 --> 15:35.750
you must tell me.

399
15:36.960 --> 15:37.750
Don't worry.

400
15:38.320 --> 15:39.150
Be careful.

401
15:39.440 --> 15:40.570
Lord Situ, let's go.

402
15:44.670 --> 15:45.480
They must be hiding something from us.

403
15:45.480 --> 15:46.150
Let's go.

404
15:46.200 --> 15:47.000
Let's go.

405
16:09.240 --> 16:10.030
Huang Mazi,

406
16:10.050 --> 16:11.600
you fought dirty!

407
16:11.790 --> 16:13.080
Go! Get our men!

408
16:13.340 --> 16:13.910
Yes!

409
16:13.940 --> 16:15.200
Today, I'm going to fight the Ji family

410
16:15.200 --> 16:16.760
to the death!

411
16:16.960 --> 16:17.750
Wu Hai,

412
16:17.750 --> 16:18.870
I'm telling you!

413
16:18.870 --> 16:20.440
Even if a Gong comes here today,

414
16:20.440 --> 16:22.360
our Master can crush him

415
16:22.360 --> 16:23.750
with just one finger!

416
16:23.750 --> 16:24.550
Say that again!

417
16:24.550 --> 16:25.750
What?

418
16:25.920 --> 16:27.010
Say that again!

419
16:27.030 --> 16:28.360
What are you going to do about it?

420
16:28.360 --> 16:28.960
What are you going to do about it?

421
16:28.960 --> 16:30.510
-The Ji family and the Gong family are fighting again! -What's the hurry?

422
16:30.510 --> 16:32.120
-It's not even your business. -Someone almost died!

423
16:32.120 --> 16:33.280
Bro.

424
16:33.840 --> 16:35.110
Are you saying

425
16:35.150 --> 16:36.510
the Ji family that runs the rice shops

426
16:36.510 --> 16:37.860
is fighting the Gong family?

427
16:37.860 --> 16:39.220
What else could it be?

428
16:39.320 --> 16:40.390
I heard Ji Ada

429
16:40.440 --> 16:41.630
is going to duel Gong Sihai!

430
16:41.630 --> 16:42.750
Go and watch!

431
16:43.120 --> 16:45.180
-You'll miss it if you're late! -Bye!

432
16:46.550 --> 16:47.510
Looks like

433
16:47.720 --> 16:49.770
there really can't be two tigers on one mountain.

434
16:49.770 --> 16:51.840
I think it's just a small pond with big egos.

435
16:51.840 --> 16:53.150
He'll be here soon! Just you wait!

436
16:53.150 --> 16:53.790
Just you wait!

437
16:53.790 --> 16:55.200
I'll beat you to death today!

438
16:55.200 --> 16:56.270
I'm telling you!

439
16:56.270 --> 16:57.240
Don't you even know

440
16:57.240 --> 16:58.240
who our Master is?

441
16:58.240 --> 16:59.750
Messing with the Ji family

442
16:59.750 --> 17:01.960
means messing with the Great Shi royal family!

443
17:01.960 --> 17:03.440
It means messing with the one

444
17:03.440 --> 17:04.160
on the throne!

445
17:04.160 --> 17:04.880
Exactly!

446
17:04.880 --> 17:05.349
Yeah!

447
17:05.349 --> 17:07.480
That's between the Gong and Ji families!

448
17:07.480 --> 17:08.839
Who do you think you are?

449
17:09.069 --> 17:10.030
No matter how loud you bark,

450
17:10.030 --> 17:12.480
you're just a dog of the Ji family!

451
17:12.550 --> 17:13.480
That's right, a dog!

452
17:13.480 --> 17:14.510
Say that again!

453
17:14.510 --> 17:15.160
A dog!

454
17:15.310 --> 17:16.270
Say it again!

455
17:16.270 --> 17:17.349
Dog! Dog! Dog!

456
17:17.349 --> 17:18.589
-I'll kill you! -Dog!

457
17:18.640 --> 17:19.900
What's all this noise?

458
17:20.310 --> 17:21.339
Master Ji is here.

459
17:22.190 --> 17:23.130
Master!

460
17:23.240 --> 17:24.319
You're finally here!

461
17:24.319 --> 17:25.619
Look what he did to me!

462
17:25.640 --> 17:27.130
Stand up for me, Master!

463
17:27.160 --> 17:28.510
Why are you fighting?

464
17:28.510 --> 17:29.550
Just you wait!

465
17:33.570 --> 17:33.920
[Ji Ada, Owner of Ji's Rice Shop]

466
17:33.920 --> 17:36.510
A few people getting hurt or killed is no big deal,

467
17:36.510 --> 17:37.440
but what about

468
17:37.850 --> 17:39.660
your Master Gong's

469
17:39.750 --> 17:40.830
reputation?

470
17:41.550 --> 17:42.350
Mr. Ji,

471
17:43.030 --> 17:44.070
stop being

472
17:44.070 --> 17:45.270
so sarcastic here!

473
17:45.750 --> 17:46.720
You were the ones

474
17:46.720 --> 17:48.310
who broke the rules on the dock first.

475
17:48.310 --> 17:49.720
How could you

476
17:49.880 --> 17:51.400
keep delaying payment

477
17:51.440 --> 17:52.960
for using our ships?

478
17:52.960 --> 17:53.750
You should see

479
17:53.750 --> 17:54.640
how much rice you confiscated from us!

480
17:54.640 --> 17:56.160
A debt must be repaid.

481
17:56.240 --> 17:58.030
That's only fair.

482
17:58.270 --> 17:59.350
Besides,

483
17:59.440 --> 18:01.030
it's just a few bags of rice.

484
18:01.160 --> 18:02.070
Did you really

485
18:02.090 --> 18:03.470
have to go this far?

486
18:04.310 --> 18:06.710
Is your Ji family that desperate for money?

487
18:09.960 --> 18:12.240
As far as I, Ji Ada, am concerned,

488
18:12.550 --> 18:14.490
it's a huge deal.

489
18:14.520 --> 18:16.530
Let alone a few bags of rice,

490
18:16.720 --> 18:18.250
even if it's a single grain,

491
18:18.720 --> 18:20.920
none of you will get

492
18:21.160 --> 18:23.050
to eat it without my permission.

493
18:24.640 --> 18:26.160
We've shown your Gong family some respect

494
18:26.160 --> 18:27.380
in the past,

495
18:27.830 --> 18:30.160
but you just don't know how to appreciate it.

496
18:30.160 --> 18:32.550
The Gong flag only flies on the sea,

497
18:33.160 --> 18:34.920
but once you come ashore,

498
18:35.440 --> 18:37.420
the land

499
18:37.440 --> 18:39.400
belongs to the Ji family.

500
18:39.440 --> 18:40.640
This Ji Ada

501
18:40.960 --> 18:43.490
really throws his weight around just because

502
18:43.510 --> 18:45.030
he's related to the royal family.

503
18:45.030 --> 18:46.000
Do you few really think

504
18:46.000 --> 18:46.510
you're in a position

505
18:46.510 --> 18:47.910
to challenge our master?

506
18:47.960 --> 18:49.240
Go get that Gong here

507
18:49.240 --> 18:50.030
now!

508
18:50.030 --> 18:52.690
If you've got the guts, wait till my men get here!

509
19:03.010 --> 19:04.790
[Brocade and Silks]

510
19:09.350 --> 19:10.480
Black Silk Leopard!

511
19:11.030 --> 19:11.920
Is this a dog?

512
19:11.920 --> 19:12.680
It's a bear!

513
19:16.750 --> 19:18.750
They say it once bit through a man's neck,

514
19:18.750 --> 19:19.920
and that's how it got the nickname

515
19:19.920 --> 19:20.980
"Throatbreaker."

516
19:21.440 --> 19:23.900
-Look at how vicious it is. -Throatbreaker?

517
19:24.240 --> 19:25.350
Our master said

518
19:25.750 --> 19:27.550
not to bother him over every little thing

519
19:27.550 --> 19:28.700
at the dock.

520
19:29.070 --> 19:30.310
Just bring Black Silk Leopard over

521
19:30.310 --> 19:31.110
to take a look.

522
19:36.980 --> 19:37.900
Just now,

523
19:38.070 --> 19:39.730
who was causing trouble here?

524
19:39.750 --> 19:40.550
Mr. Ji.

525
19:41.370 --> 19:42.770
Say something, will you?

526
19:43.880 --> 19:45.350
Black Silk Leopard.

527
19:46.440 --> 19:47.640
What a fine dog.

528
19:48.190 --> 19:50.210
Go back and tell Gong Sihai

529
19:50.750 --> 19:52.880
I really like this Black Silk Leopard.

530
19:53.350 --> 19:54.750
Tell him to name his price.

531
19:54.750 --> 19:55.970
Whatever it costs,

532
19:56.000 --> 19:57.180
I'll pay double.

533
19:57.210 --> 19:59.210
That's a deal you can't lose, right?

534
20:00.920 --> 20:02.920
Having a chance to do me a favor

535
20:03.310 --> 20:05.390
is a blessing for the Gong family.

536
20:05.420 --> 20:06.920
Ji Ada, what are you talking about?

537
20:06.920 --> 20:08.680
Don't push it too far!

538
20:11.720 --> 20:12.510
Move!

539
20:20.640 --> 20:21.440
Guards!

540
20:27.490 --> 20:28.290
Master!

541
20:28.310 --> 20:29.550
Master, are you alright?

542
20:29.550 --> 20:30.950
-Let's go! -Let's go now!

543
20:31.030 --> 20:32.070
Let's go now!

544
20:32.090 --> 20:32.900
Let's go!

545
20:38.880 --> 20:39.510
Are you alright?

546
20:39.510 --> 20:39.920
I'm fine.

547
20:39.920 --> 20:41.830
So it's the two Divine Constables.

548
20:41.830 --> 20:42.960
We meet again.

549
20:43.310 --> 20:45.550
If you hadn't intervened just now,

550
20:45.640 --> 20:47.370
it would have been a disaster.

551
20:47.390 --> 20:49.310
So you knew it would cause trouble?

552
20:49.310 --> 20:50.680
Then why did you bring this beast out

553
20:50.680 --> 20:51.640
to show off?

554
20:51.960 --> 20:53.960
Weren't you afraid it would hurt someone?

555
20:53.960 --> 20:54.960
I absolutely

556
20:55.550 --> 20:57.510
cannot agree with you, My Lord.

557
20:57.830 --> 21:00.030
Although Black Silk Leopard is fierce,

558
21:00.160 --> 21:01.550
it is extremely smart

559
21:01.640 --> 21:03.770
and would never bite people randomly.

560
21:04.160 --> 21:05.830
As you saw just now,

561
21:05.850 --> 21:07.090
if Ji Ada hadn't

562
21:07.120 --> 21:08.680
provoked our Gong family first,

563
21:08.680 --> 21:10.550
how could Black Silk Leopard, eager to

564
21:10.550 --> 21:12.350
protect its master, have attacked on its own?

565
21:12.350 --> 21:13.310
Right, My Lord?

566
21:14.350 --> 21:15.400
So Black Silk Leopard

567
21:15.400 --> 21:16.720
is indeed a good dog.

568
21:17.160 --> 21:19.160
Does it just bite through the throat

569
21:19.160 --> 21:20.750
of whoever its master tells it to?

570
21:20.750 --> 21:21.550
My Lady,

571
21:21.680 --> 21:23.830
you can't joke about this.

572
21:23.980 --> 21:25.350
Throatbreaker?

573
21:25.350 --> 21:27.160
It's just a baseless rumor.

574
21:27.270 --> 21:28.480
It never happened.

575
21:30.880 --> 21:31.960
Today, a corpse

576
21:31.980 --> 21:34.180
was found in the Yan River.

577
21:34.550 --> 21:35.550
Mr. Reda,

578
21:35.750 --> 21:37.070
please go back to your residence

579
21:37.070 --> 21:38.240
and tell Master Gong Sihai

580
21:38.240 --> 21:39.510
that the Divine Constable Bureau invites him

581
21:39.510 --> 21:41.840
to the county office to identify the body.

582
21:49.130 --> 21:54.020
[Identifying the Bones, Finding a Mother for an Orphaned Girl]

583
22:52.480 --> 22:53.880
The green-haired demon?

584
22:54.200 --> 22:55.000
Meng Rui,

585
22:55.310 --> 22:56.110
watch out.

586
23:05.470 --> 23:06.370
Chiying bugs!

587
23:16.000 --> 23:17.190
It's a kid.

588
23:19.830 --> 23:20.840
Chiying bugs.

589
23:22.410 --> 23:23.170
Don't move!

590
23:24.030 --> 23:25.050
It seems

591
23:25.790 --> 23:27.590
it's exactly as Old Geezer said.

592
23:38.200 --> 23:39.330
They are fireflies.

593
23:43.080 --> 23:44.030
You brat,

594
23:45.170 --> 23:46.690
you're quite smart.

595
23:46.720 --> 23:48.270
You know how to use fireflies for light

596
23:48.270 --> 23:49.510
when looking for things.

597
23:49.510 --> 23:50.310
I guess

598
23:51.510 --> 23:53.240
you're the green-haired demon

599
23:53.560 --> 23:55.560
they've been talking about, right?

600
23:59.750 --> 24:00.660
Why were you

601
24:01.240 --> 24:03.040
digging up those bones just now?

602
24:03.640 --> 24:04.720
What were you looking for?

603
24:04.720 --> 24:05.830
What's your name?

604
24:06.310 --> 24:07.120
Xia...

605
24:08.140 --> 24:08.340
[Xia Jiuying]

606
24:08.340 --> 24:09.240
Jiu...

607
24:11.400 --> 24:12.200
Ying!

608
24:20.720 --> 24:21.740
Fellow villagers,

609
24:21.740 --> 24:23.030
don't panic.

610
24:24.270 --> 24:25.090
Please step forward

611
24:25.090 --> 24:25.240
[Mingling County Government]

612
24:25.240 --> 24:27.440
and identify the deceased's clothing.

613
24:27.720 --> 24:29.980
Anyone who recognizes this person

614
24:30.240 --> 24:31.880
or can provide any clues

615
24:32.510 --> 24:34.910
will be rewarded by the county government.

616
24:40.890 --> 24:44.600
[Gong Sihai, Owner of Gong's Shipping]

617
24:46.910 --> 24:49.890
[Mingling County Government]

618
24:50.480 --> 24:52.110
I'm Gong Sihai. I'm sorry

619
24:52.130 --> 24:53.970
for being late.

620
24:54.070 --> 24:55.350
This is the head of the Gong family,

621
24:55.350 --> 24:56.160
Gong Sihai,

622
24:56.270 --> 24:58.010
known as Fourth Master Gong.

623
24:58.400 --> 24:59.510
This is Lady Constable Frost,

624
24:59.510 --> 25:00.920
and this is Lord Constable Iron.

625
25:00.920 --> 25:02.270
Greetings, Lady Constable Frost,

626
25:02.270 --> 25:03.470
Lord Constable Iron.

627
25:06.310 --> 25:07.440
Fourth Master Gong.

628
25:08.110 --> 25:09.920
Please take a close look.

629
25:10.070 --> 25:11.720
Do you know this person?

630
25:24.310 --> 25:25.240
No.

631
25:28.510 --> 25:30.800
The corpse is mutilated beyond recognition.

632
25:30.800 --> 25:31.930
Fourth Master Gong,

633
25:32.310 --> 25:34.640
how can you tell you don't recognize him?

634
25:35.000 --> 25:36.880
It's exactly because I couldn't tell

635
25:36.880 --> 25:38.720
that I said I don't recognize him.

636
25:38.720 --> 25:40.030
If it is someone familiar,

637
25:40.030 --> 25:40.960
even if mutilated beyond recognition,

638
25:40.960 --> 25:42.690
you will still recognize them.

639
25:43.200 --> 25:44.440
Lady Constable Frost,

640
25:44.440 --> 25:46.040
you are implying something.

641
25:47.720 --> 25:49.590
If I'm guessing correctly,

642
25:49.640 --> 25:50.440
this person

643
25:50.590 --> 25:52.200
was bitten to death, right?

644
25:52.220 --> 25:53.280
When Reda came back

645
25:53.480 --> 25:54.880
from the dock today

646
25:55.240 --> 25:56.400
and told me you two

647
25:56.880 --> 25:58.310
had invited me to identify a body,

648
25:58.310 --> 25:59.310
I figured

649
25:59.480 --> 26:00.720
that because of

650
26:01.030 --> 26:02.960
Black Silk Leopard's appearance,

651
26:03.240 --> 26:04.640
you two had probably already considered me

652
26:04.640 --> 26:06.000
a suspect.

653
26:06.070 --> 26:08.680
It's about a human life. How can we afford to overlook anything?

654
26:08.680 --> 26:10.310
The case hasn't been solved yet.

655
26:10.310 --> 26:11.830
Until we catch the real killer,

656
26:11.830 --> 26:13.310
anyone could be a suspect.

657
26:13.310 --> 26:14.510
Then let me say a word

658
26:14.510 --> 26:15.510
in my own defense.

659
26:15.830 --> 26:16.880
I keep Black Silk Leopard

660
26:16.880 --> 26:18.880
as a guard dog.

661
26:18.880 --> 26:21.080
I rarely even take it out of the mansion.

662
26:21.720 --> 26:23.310
And I would never

663
26:23.310 --> 26:24.440
let it hurt anyone.

664
26:25.790 --> 26:27.440
As for what happened at the dock today,

665
26:27.440 --> 26:29.030
as you could see,

666
26:29.440 --> 26:31.110
it was purely an accident.

667
26:35.830 --> 26:37.590
Fourth Master Gong, don't get worked up.

668
26:37.590 --> 26:39.110
We never said it was you.

669
26:39.720 --> 26:40.440
Since you don't recognize him,

670
26:40.440 --> 26:41.970
then there's nothing else.

671
26:42.400 --> 26:43.270
You may leave.

672
26:45.790 --> 26:47.110
Then I will take my leave.

673
26:47.110 --> 26:47.920
Please.

674
26:51.240 --> 26:52.480
People from Tianhuang City are here.

675
26:52.480 --> 26:53.400
Things are unsettled right now.

676
26:53.400 --> 26:54.880
Find the Young Master and bring him back at once.

677
26:54.880 --> 26:55.640
Yes.

678
26:58.010 --> 27:03.110
[Mingling County Government]

679
27:03.110 --> 27:04.000
Lord Situ,

680
27:04.000 --> 27:05.400
please have the body taken to the morgue

681
27:05.400 --> 27:06.110
and kept under guard.

682
27:06.110 --> 27:07.480
I need to continue the autopsy.

683
27:07.480 --> 27:08.310
Alright.

684
27:08.680 --> 27:09.440
Lai.

685
27:09.440 --> 27:10.110
Yes.

686
27:10.350 --> 27:10.910
Lift it.

687
27:10.910 --> 27:13.930
[Mingling County Government]

688
27:15.710 --> 27:16.590
Everyone, disperse.

689
27:16.590 --> 27:17.790
Stop gathering here.

690
27:22.830 --> 27:24.070
You noticed him too?

691
27:24.210 --> 27:25.880
He stood at the very back of the crowd,

692
27:25.880 --> 27:27.680
but he couldn't stop looking in.

693
27:27.680 --> 27:29.270
Even when he left, his pace

694
27:29.270 --> 27:31.130
was faster than everyone else's.

695
27:31.480 --> 27:33.110
He must know the deceased.

696
27:33.720 --> 27:34.480
Did you notice

697
27:34.480 --> 27:36.110
his ears just now?

698
27:36.790 --> 27:37.590
Cauliflower ears?

699
27:37.590 --> 27:38.310
Exactly.

700
27:38.310 --> 27:39.640
They are exactly the same as those of the corpse from the Yan River.

701
27:39.640 --> 27:41.310
I'm very familiar with ears like these.

702
27:41.310 --> 27:41.920
You don't get ears like these

703
27:41.920 --> 27:43.790
unless you've trained in wrestling

704
27:43.790 --> 27:45.640
for 10 or 20 years.

705
27:46.400 --> 27:47.320
So,

706
27:47.400 --> 27:48.720
the victim must have been skilled

707
27:48.720 --> 27:49.720
in wrestling too.

708
27:49.720 --> 27:50.480
[Mingling County Government]

709
27:50.480 --> 27:51.510
There must be some connection

710
27:51.510 --> 27:52.880
between the two of them.

711
27:53.830 --> 27:54.640
Try this.

712
27:57.310 --> 27:58.110
Eat up.

713
27:58.170 --> 27:59.070
Don't pick up dirty things

714
27:59.070 --> 28:00.800
from the ground to eat anymore.

715
28:03.640 --> 28:04.440
Xia Jiuying.

716
28:04.480 --> 28:05.310
I was asking

717
28:05.340 --> 28:06.660
where you live.

718
28:06.830 --> 28:07.880
But you brought me

719
28:07.880 --> 28:09.270
to Ji's Rice Shop.

720
28:09.310 --> 28:10.770
Are you from the Ji family?

721
28:12.920 --> 28:13.980
Then let me ask you.

722
28:14.640 --> 28:16.240
Does the Ji family keep dogs?

723
28:22.110 --> 28:23.640
Do they or not?

724
28:29.510 --> 28:30.530
This child.

725
28:30.680 --> 28:31.740
I've asked around.

726
28:32.470 --> 28:33.440
The people around here

727
28:33.440 --> 28:34.590
all know this child.

728
28:34.590 --> 28:35.960
They say she's a servant of the Ji family.

729
28:35.960 --> 28:37.240
She is a girl.

730
28:37.720 --> 28:39.120
With her hair a mess,

731
28:39.400 --> 28:41.400
the way she's wolfing down her food,

732
28:41.400 --> 28:42.860
and her tattered clothes,

733
28:44.030 --> 28:45.270
it's obvious she's been poorly treated

734
28:45.270 --> 28:46.720
at Ji Mansion.

735
28:50.590 --> 28:51.400
Meng Rui.

736
28:53.230 --> 28:55.030
Look at the scar on her neck.

737
28:55.420 --> 28:57.110
Doesn't it look like it was caused

738
28:57.110 --> 28:57.920
by a dog chain?

739
28:59.200 --> 29:00.030
I'm full.

740
29:00.060 --> 29:00.500
I'm leaving.

741
29:00.500 --> 29:01.230
Xia Jiuying!

742
29:03.060 --> 29:03.950
Stand still.

743
29:04.640 --> 29:05.480
Listen to me.

744
29:05.560 --> 29:07.770
Although you are a servant of Ji Mansion,

745
29:07.770 --> 29:08.940
if in the future

746
29:09.480 --> 29:10.750
Ji Ada treats you badly,

747
29:10.750 --> 29:11.550
or

748
29:11.780 --> 29:12.980
if he dares to hit you,

749
29:14.070 --> 29:15.470
you don't have to go back.

750
29:16.830 --> 29:17.640
No!

751
29:18.510 --> 29:19.590
I want to go back!

752
29:25.680 --> 29:26.770
This child.

753
29:27.150 --> 29:28.340
[Rice Shop]

754
29:30.270 --> 29:31.310
You've been watching

755
29:31.310 --> 29:33.070
this rice shop since earlier.

756
29:33.240 --> 29:34.440
Any clues?

757
29:35.270 --> 29:36.480
Since we got here,

758
29:36.920 --> 29:38.070
a total of 27 people

759
29:38.070 --> 29:39.590
have gone into the rice shop,

760
29:39.590 --> 29:40.790
but only five or six

761
29:41.070 --> 29:42.100
have come out.

762
29:42.100 --> 29:42.720
[Rice Shop]

763
29:42.720 --> 29:44.190
Whether they bought rice or not,

764
29:44.190 --> 29:44.510
[Rice Shop]

765
29:44.510 --> 29:45.710
they have to come out.

766
29:46.400 --> 29:48.110
Where did the remaining

767
29:49.010 --> 29:50.050
20 or so people go?

768
29:50.240 --> 29:52.340
They couldn't have just vanished into thin air.

769
29:52.340 --> 29:53.360
So,

770
29:54.640 --> 29:55.880
in this rice shop,

771
29:56.310 --> 29:58.000
there must be a hidden secret.

772
29:58.790 --> 30:00.110
Then let's go and see

773
30:00.440 --> 30:01.480
the quality

774
30:01.480 --> 30:02.810
of the Ji family's rice.

775
30:04.110 --> 30:06.070
Before we go, we...

776
30:07.880 --> 30:09.310
need to dress up.

777
30:09.880 --> 30:12.080
Gold rice, silver rice, and pearl rice.

778
30:12.240 --> 30:14.640
They say in the Ji family's rice bags,

779
30:14.640 --> 30:16.100
there are rare treasures.

780
30:16.110 --> 30:16.920
Today,

781
30:17.830 --> 30:18.880
I'd like to

782
30:19.110 --> 30:20.880
broaden my horizons here.

783
30:21.480 --> 30:22.310
Rui,

784
30:22.880 --> 30:24.480
go get the manager.

785
30:24.640 --> 30:25.790
I...

786
30:26.000 --> 30:28.260
am going to spend a lot of money here today

787
30:29.070 --> 30:30.730
and play for some real stakes.

788
30:31.110 --> 30:31.920
Manager.

789
30:33.310 --> 30:34.110
Coming!

790
30:35.680 --> 30:36.640
Gentlemen,

791
30:36.720 --> 30:38.110
what would you like to buy?

792
30:38.110 --> 30:39.240
That depends on

793
30:40.030 --> 30:41.650
what you sell here.

794
30:41.650 --> 30:42.590
[Grain]

795
30:42.590 --> 30:43.880
You must be joking.

796
30:43.880 --> 30:45.110
This is a rice shop,

797
30:45.110 --> 30:47.110
so naturally we sell rice and grain.

798
30:47.590 --> 30:48.590
Rice sounds fine.

799
30:48.680 --> 30:50.310
There is an ancient saying about a golden millet dream.

800
30:50.310 --> 30:51.110
Today,

801
30:51.880 --> 30:52.880
I want to

802
30:52.880 --> 30:54.940
live it up and forget myself for once.

803
30:57.440 --> 30:58.590
I want to buy that.

804
31:00.070 --> 31:02.270
What are you talking about?

805
31:03.510 --> 31:04.790
That.

806
31:13.480 --> 31:14.740
To be honest, Manager,

807
31:14.880 --> 31:15.880
Rui and I

808
31:15.880 --> 31:18.270
came here especially

809
31:18.500 --> 31:20.100
because of your reputation.

810
31:22.750 --> 31:24.270
Oh, that?

811
31:24.480 --> 31:25.270
Sir,

812
31:25.310 --> 31:27.380
you've come to the right place.

813
31:28.070 --> 31:29.070
Please follow me.

814
31:30.030 --> 31:30.830
Please.

815
31:31.310 --> 31:33.000
Let's go, Rui.

816
31:34.510 --> 31:35.110
Please.

817
31:35.110 --> 31:35.680
We clearly saw him

818
31:35.680 --> 31:36.880
come this way.

819
31:38.310 --> 31:39.680
Yan, Miss Bai?

820
31:40.680 --> 31:42.830
Are you two here to spend

821
31:42.880 --> 31:44.080
some money today too?

822
31:46.560 --> 31:47.900
[Grain]

823
31:50.880 --> 31:51.590
We heard

824
31:51.590 --> 31:52.830
you were here,

825
31:52.850 --> 31:53.610
so we thought

826
31:53.640 --> 31:54.680
we'd come and join the fun.

827
31:54.680 --> 31:55.510
Right, right.

828
31:55.530 --> 31:57.190
I'm just following my sister.

829
31:57.510 --> 31:58.830
You came at the right time.

830
31:58.830 --> 31:59.640
Today,

831
31:59.920 --> 32:01.310
all expenses

832
32:01.510 --> 32:03.030
are on me.

833
32:06.910 --> 32:07.710
Everyone,

834
32:08.070 --> 32:09.200
please come inside.

835
32:15.040 --> 32:16.080
I didn't expect

836
32:16.110 --> 32:17.240
there to be a whole other world

837
32:17.240 --> 32:18.500
behind this rice shop.

838
32:20.680 --> 32:21.510
It finally feels like

839
32:21.510 --> 32:23.200
a major case.

840
32:23.200 --> 32:25.310
Come on, place your bets! One hundred!

841
32:25.310 --> 32:26.640
Bets are final!

842
32:38.400 --> 32:39.200
Looks like

843
32:39.950 --> 32:41.950
this is an underground boxing ring.

844
32:42.070 --> 32:44.270
Let's split up and see

845
32:44.510 --> 32:46.910
if there are any other illegal activities.

846
33:05.110 --> 33:06.240
Hit him!

847
33:11.110 --> 33:11.880
Come on!

848
33:14.880 --> 33:17.030
-Bravo! -Hit him!

849
33:17.030 --> 33:18.270
Hurry! Hurry!

850
33:18.270 --> 33:19.070
That's the guy

851
33:19.070 --> 33:20.070
Zhenzhu and I followed

852
33:20.070 --> 33:21.000
from the county office.

853
33:21.000 --> 33:23.480
Looks like the victim in the Yan River corpse case

854
33:23.480 --> 33:25.880
used to fight underground boxing here too.

855
33:48.400 --> 33:49.270
Harder!

856
33:49.270 --> 33:50.550
Go!

857
33:54.880 --> 33:56.100
I want my mother!

858
33:56.240 --> 33:58.370
-I want my mother! -Jiuying! Jiuying.

859
33:58.640 --> 33:59.880
It's me, Gong Le.

860
34:02.240 --> 34:04.870
[Gong Le, Young Master of the Gong Family]

861
34:04.890 --> 34:05.760
Who is it?

862
34:06.090 --> 34:07.650
Who's teasing the dog here?

863
34:08.719 --> 34:10.000
Huang Mazi is coming!

864
34:11.400 --> 34:13.219
Who is it? Who's back there?

865
34:25.090 --> 34:26.040
Come on, Jiuying.

866
34:26.040 --> 34:27.920
-I'm not going! -Come on.

867
34:29.480 --> 34:30.280
Be a good girl.

868
34:35.150 --> 34:35.960
Let's go.

869
34:37.880 --> 34:38.670
Let's go.

870
34:44.070 --> 34:44.880
Beat him!

871
34:44.880 --> 34:45.780
Go!

872
34:50.840 --> 34:52.130
Not eating?

873
34:52.670 --> 34:53.590
You're too spoiled.

874
34:53.590 --> 34:54.230
Master!

875
34:54.710 --> 34:55.510
Master!

876
34:55.880 --> 34:56.590
Come on!

877
34:57.230 --> 34:59.360
This... This girl came back on her own?

878
35:01.070 --> 35:02.440
Don't bother me here.

879
35:03.480 --> 35:04.230
Drag her away.

880
35:04.230 --> 35:06.690
Give her a whipping and starve her for 3 days.

881
35:06.960 --> 35:08.220
If she runs away again,

882
35:08.400 --> 35:09.600
break one of her legs.

883
35:10.880 --> 35:12.140
I dare you to run again!

884
35:15.800 --> 35:16.590
Master.

885
35:17.630 --> 35:19.300
Are you still worrying about

886
35:19.330 --> 35:21.300
Black Silk Leopard?

887
35:21.440 --> 35:23.380
I've been having bad luck lately.

888
35:23.440 --> 35:24.760
Bad things

889
35:26.880 --> 35:28.960
keep happening one after another.

890
35:37.800 --> 35:40.150
-Bravo! -We won!

891
35:56.670 --> 35:57.630
We won!

892
36:00.030 --> 36:01.050
One more round!

893
36:03.150 --> 36:03.890
How is it?

894
36:08.030 --> 36:08.920
You piece of trash!

895
36:08.920 --> 36:09.960
Look at you!

896
36:09.960 --> 36:11.220
You made me lose money!

897
36:28.710 --> 36:29.510
Rice paste?

898
36:29.880 --> 36:31.070
Cloth strips dipped in rice paste

899
36:31.070 --> 36:31.880
become extremely hard

900
36:31.880 --> 36:33.150
once they dry.

901
36:33.590 --> 36:35.960
Wrapping them around your hands protects them

902
36:35.960 --> 36:38.360
and makes your punches much more powerful.

903
36:39.070 --> 36:40.190
I see.

904
36:40.230 --> 36:41.150
Alright, he won!

905
36:41.150 --> 36:42.850
Will you keep your promise?

906
36:42.880 --> 36:43.670
Zhe Shan!

907
36:43.670 --> 36:45.130
Call Zhe Shan out to fight!

908
36:45.510 --> 36:46.510
Where is Zhe Shan?

909
36:46.880 --> 36:47.960
Have you found him?

910
36:48.880 --> 36:50.030
Not yet.

911
36:50.190 --> 36:51.000
Master.

912
36:51.080 --> 36:52.680
Right now, among our boxers,

913
36:52.840 --> 36:53.880
besides Zhe Shan,

914
36:53.960 --> 36:55.220
only Tiesha is decent.

915
36:55.230 --> 36:56.090
As for the rest,

916
36:56.230 --> 36:58.440
there are really few who can really fight.

917
36:58.440 --> 36:59.490
The matches in the arena

918
36:59.490 --> 37:01.280
are getting less and less interesting.

919
37:01.280 --> 37:02.230
In the future,

920
37:02.400 --> 37:04.480
I'm afraid fewer people will place bets.

921
37:04.480 --> 37:06.190
Gamblers may love to gamble,

922
37:06.360 --> 37:07.690
but they're not stupid.

923
37:08.590 --> 37:10.280
If there are no new tricks,

924
37:10.760 --> 37:11.640
taking all

925
37:11.670 --> 37:13.280
their money

926
37:13.280 --> 37:14.670
won't be that simple.

927
37:15.230 --> 37:16.030
Where is Zhe Shan?

928
37:16.030 --> 37:16.880
Bro,

929
37:16.960 --> 37:18.670
who is this Zhe Shan you're talking about?

930
37:18.670 --> 37:19.880
You don't even know him?

931
37:19.880 --> 37:21.670
He is the Ji family's top boxer.

932
37:21.670 --> 37:22.760
He is ruthless,

933
37:22.760 --> 37:24.220
winning 9 out of 10 fights.

934
37:24.320 --> 37:25.110
This Zhe Shan

935
37:25.130 --> 37:26.400
hasn't come out for a long time, right?

936
37:26.400 --> 37:27.360
Exactly.

937
37:27.360 --> 37:28.070
He made me

938
37:28.070 --> 37:30.130
lose money for half a month straight.

939
37:30.630 --> 37:31.590
Tell Zhe Shan to come out!

940
37:31.590 --> 37:32.340
Zhe Shan!

941
37:32.920 --> 37:33.590
Come out!

942
37:34.000 --> 37:34.880
In my opinion,

943
37:34.880 --> 37:36.880
that corpse is most likely Zhe Shan.

944
37:37.630 --> 37:38.440
Do you think

945
37:38.480 --> 37:39.630
it's possible

946
37:40.000 --> 37:41.320
that Zhe Shan was bitten to death

947
37:41.320 --> 37:42.580
by the Ji family's dog?

948
37:44.190 --> 37:45.720
The Ji family keeps dogs,

949
37:45.840 --> 37:47.000
but they wouldn't let them hurt people,

950
37:47.000 --> 37:47.840
let alone kill

951
37:47.840 --> 37:49.070
their own boxer.

952
37:49.280 --> 37:50.400
I don't think so.

953
38:00.590 --> 38:02.670
How come I forgot you?

954
38:03.110 --> 38:04.010
Shui!

955
38:04.360 --> 38:05.960
Send Xia Jiuying to the ring!

956
38:07.920 --> 38:08.710
Master,

957
38:08.960 --> 38:10.250
can this girl do it?

958
38:10.920 --> 38:12.110
Don't forget,

959
38:12.110 --> 38:13.320
she fought wild dogs for food

960
38:13.320 --> 38:14.920
at the age of seven,

961
38:15.190 --> 38:16.360
and at nine, she could kill

962
38:16.360 --> 38:17.800
an alpha wolf.

963
38:18.190 --> 38:19.760
Winning or losing doesn't matter.

964
38:19.760 --> 38:21.010
What matters is...

965
38:21.960 --> 38:24.360
putting on a good show for the people down there.

966
38:24.360 --> 38:25.340
Otherwise,

967
38:26.150 --> 38:27.450
they'll think

968
38:27.590 --> 38:30.110
there's no one left in the Ji family.

969
38:32.750 --> 38:33.590
Yes.

970
38:35.320 --> 38:36.110
Come on.

971
38:36.760 --> 38:37.590
Go!

972
38:45.760 --> 38:46.590
Go!

973
39:03.400 --> 39:04.560
Xia Jiuying?

974
39:05.030 --> 39:05.840
Who?

975
39:06.440 --> 39:07.150
Meng Rui and I met her

976
39:07.150 --> 39:08.760
in the Corpse Forest Graveyard.

977
39:08.760 --> 39:10.760
The green-haired demon Situ Bo mentioned

978
39:10.760 --> 39:11.800
must be her.

979
39:15.400 --> 39:16.760
Let's go take a look.

980
39:19.190 --> 39:20.000
Who is she?

981
39:22.910 --> 39:24.260
I'm asking you!

982
39:24.400 --> 39:25.590
Are you kidding me?

983
39:25.670 --> 39:27.530
Having this little brat fight me?

984
39:31.100 --> 39:32.360
Teach her a good lesson!

985
39:32.360 --> 39:33.000
Will you fight or not?

986
39:33.000 --> 39:33.680
Yeah!

987
39:36.190 --> 39:37.040
Fight!

988
39:38.710 --> 39:40.070
Beat her to death!

989
39:47.220 --> 39:47.920
[Small]

990
39:47.920 --> 39:48.530
Come on, place your bets!

991
39:48.530 --> 39:49.590
[Xia Jiuying]

992
39:49.590 --> 39:51.760
Xia Jiuying or Tiesha?

993
39:52.480 --> 39:54.360
Bets are final! Bets are final!

994
39:54.400 --> 39:56.190
Come on, hurry up!

995
39:56.360 --> 39:57.670
Bets are final!

996
39:57.830 --> 39:58.280
[Xia Jiuying]

997
39:58.280 --> 39:58.800
Tiesha!

998
40:01.440 --> 40:02.070
Bet on Tiesha!

999
40:02.070 --> 40:03.540
Hurry up and pay!

1000
40:03.710 --> 40:04.830
Wolf cub,

1001
40:05.760 --> 40:06.800
whether I can

1002
40:06.800 --> 40:08.260
win big this time

1003
40:08.960 --> 40:10.070
depends on you.
